ext":"Now|strong=\"H6258\"many|strong=\"H7227\"nations|strong=\"H1471\"have|strong=\"H5869\"assembled against|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H5921\", that|strong=\"H1471\"say,  \n“Let|strong=\"H6258\"her|strong=\"H5921\"be|strong=\"H1471\"defiled|strong=\"H2610\",  \nand|strong=\"H5869\"let|strong=\"H6258\"our|strong=\"H5921\"eye|strong=\"H5869\"gloat|strong=\"H2372\"over|strong=\"H5921\"Zion|strong=\"H6726\".”   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"But|strong=\"H3588\"they|strong=\"H1992\"don’t know|strong=\"H3045\"the|strong=\"H3588\"thoughts|strong=\"H4284\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nneither|strong=\"H3808\"do|strong=\"H3068\"they|strong=\"H1992\"understand|strong=\"H3045\"his|strong=\"H3068\"counsel|strong=\"H6098\";  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"he|strong=\"H3588\"has|strong=\"H3068\"gathered|strong=\"H6908\"them|strong=\"H1992\"like|strong=\"H3808\"the|strong=\"H3588\"sheaves|strong=\"H5995\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3588\"threshing|strong=\"H1637\"floor|strong=\"H1637\".   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"Arise|strong=\"H6965\"and|strong=\"H6965\"thresh|strong=\"H1758\", daughter|strong=\"H1323\"of|strong=\"H3068\"Zion|strong=\"H6726\",  \nfor|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"make|strong=\"H7760\"your|strong=\"H3068\"horn|strong=\"H7161\"iron|strong=\"H1270\",  \nand|strong=\"H6965\"I|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"make|strong=\"H7760\"your|strong=\"H3068\"hoofs|strong=\"H6541\"bronze|strong=\"H5154\".  \nYou|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"beat in|strong=\"H3068\"pieces|strong=\"H1854\"many|strong=\"H7227\"peoples|strong=\"H5971\".  \nI|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"devote|strong=\"H2763\"their|strong=\"H3605\"gain|strong=\"H1215\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nand|strong=\"H6965\"their|strong=\"H3605\"substance|strong=\"H2428\"to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"Lord|strong=\"H3068\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"whole|strong=\"H3605\"earth.   \n"}]}
